epo Transactions\" and \"Due to Repo Transactions\" respectively. The heading \"Other Liabilities\" will continue to reflect the deposit in favor of the People's Bank of China incorporating the valuation adjustment of such transactions. This modification is in line with the best accounting practices of central banks in this matter.","(**) The final figures for the end of financial year 2022 will be reported in the opportunity of the General Balance Sheet approval."]}